    "details": "PrymEvol and Quang Luong reports:\n\n> A flaw was found in the libtiff library. A remote attacker could\n> exploit a signed integer overflow vulnerability in the\n> putcontig8bitYCbCr44tile function by providing a specially crafted\n> TIFF file. This flaw can lead to an out-of-bounds heap write due to\n> incorrect memory pointer calculations, potentially causing a denial of\n> service (application crash) or arbitrary code execution.\n",
